{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S11、S13等处把多层因果放进较长的大字句，快速扫读不如X利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更像一条能够独立读懂的连续心路：每段的情绪触发点、内在顾虑和心理转折交代得更清楚，还通过“前几次／这回”“那阵轻松过去”“起初／如今”等表达把前后串起来。像“心里空落落”“忽然隔了一层”“有点孤单”等细节，也让情绪有了更具体的层次。X的优势是简洁利落，但不少变化被压缩成“他因……而……”的结论句，部分重要的心理过渡还放在小字里；对于没有读过原文的普通观众，Y更容易理解，也更容易感受到人物为什么一步步变成这样。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "143cf010-6743-4f14-b848-b60020c70b49", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195001297882Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:51:29.091010+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5b1a3b13766481c043334f80ecab7cad114b490103a763c1dc5e09d0fe238f2b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch